{"_v":1,"id":"golden-boy-2012","cs":82,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":14,"mixed":0,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/golden-boy","q":"Golden Boy is the sort of show that makes you proud to be in a theater."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":91,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://online.wsj.com/article/SB10001424127887323401904578157362982712242.html","q":"Watching it is like standing in front of a blowtorch."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/golden-boy-theater-review-398830","d":"2012-12-06","q":"The result is majestic theater."},{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2012/legit/reviews/golden-boy-1117948879/","d":"2012-12-06","q":"It’s no act of charity, either, because the show is killer good."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/golden-boy-review-clifford-odets-revival-1.4295816","d":"2012-12-06","q":"A '30s revival that's true in style and passion"},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://www.nytimes.com/2012/12/07/theater/reviews/golden-boy-directed-by-bartlett-sher.html?pagewanted=all&_r=1&","d":"2012-12-06","q":"Throughout this blistering Theater production, directed by Bartlett Sher and featuring a superb cast of almost 20 actors — a rare feast on Broadway these days — we watch in anguished anticipation as Joe struggles with a defining question.."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/review-broadway-revival-of-clifford-odets-golden-boy-dazzles-in-the-darkness-of-boxing/2012/12/06/7e1ddabc-4012-11e2-8a5c-473797be602c_story.html","d":"2012-12-06","q":"A dazzling revival of Clifford Odets' 'Golden Boy' opened Thursday, still packing a punch after 75 years."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.nypost.com/p/entertainment/theater/golden_boy_is_knockout_for_the_most_I0mqD2OdHKfHwqLJUsqB9I","q":"There’s no easy solution in “Golden Boy,” and the play hurtles forward with the momentum of tragedy."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/2012/12/05/golden-boy-broadway-review/1742223/","d":"2012-12-05","q":"You'll be hard-pressed to find a production, even in this season of robust revivals, that packs more visceral punch."},{"cn":"Erik Haagensen","o":"Backstage","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/review/ny-theater/broadway/clifford-odets-golden-boy-lincoln-center-theater-bartlett-sher/","q":"\"Golden Boy\" is grand and glorious theater."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/2012/12/06/theater-review-golden-boy/","d":"2012-12-06","q":"The 19 actors in the Lincoln Center revival are so good that you look beyond creaks in the melodrama."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-golden-boy-3-stars-1.4301761","q":"Bartlett Sher, who staged Odets' riveting family drama 'Awake and Sing!' in 2006, directs with an emphasis on period style. Nowadays, most play revivals are headlined by a single, well-known film star."},{"cn":"Adam Markovitz","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20364394_20654121,00.html","d":"2012-12-06","q":"The story still has plenty of energy and surefooted emotion even if it doesn't quite pack a knockout punch."},{"cn":"Jeremy Gerard","o":"Bloomberg","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.businessweek.com/news/2012-12-06/boxer-s-dream-dies-in-golden-abe-s-christmas-review","d":"2012-12-06","q":"More than the scenery is creaky in Bartlett Sher’s good- looking but oddly cast and unengaging production."},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/arts_entertainment/theater/182489731_Theater_review___Golden_Boy__a_loser_in_a_decision.html?page=all","q":"Add in unimpressive performances, and the result is a long evening that, for all its slam-bang moments, is tedious and uninvolving."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/golden-boy/","d":"2013-01-18","q":"That aside, this Depression-era, 1937 revival is riveting for just about every moment of the nearly 3 hours, two intermissions at the Belasco Theatre, where Golden Boy first appeared."}],"au":{"score":76,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":82,"c":9,"sr":4.1},"ss":{"s":70,"c":8}}},"ta":"111 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2012-11-09","ca":[{"n":"Michael Aronov","r":"Siggie"},{"n":"Danny Burstein","r":"Tokio"},{"n":"Demosthenes Chrysan","r":"Lewis"},{"n":"Anthony Crivello","r":"Eddie Fuselli"},{"n":"Sean Cullen","r":"Drake"},{"n":"Dagmara Dominczyk","r":"Anna"},{"n":"Ned Eisenberg","r":"Roxy Gottleib"},{"n":"Brad Fleischer","r":"Pepper White"},{"n":"Karl Glusman","r":"Call Boy"},{"n":"Jonathan Hadary","r":"Mr. Carp"},{"n":"Daniel H. Jenkins","r":"Barker"},{"n":"Danny Mastrogiorgio","r":"Tom Moody"},{"n":"Dion Mucciacito","r":"Sam"},{"n":"Seth Numrich","r":"Joe Bonaparte"},{"n":"Vayu O'Donnell","r":"Driscoll"},{"n":"Lucas Caleb Rooney","r":"Frank Bonaparte"},{"n":"Tony Shalhoub","r":"Mr. Bonaparte"},{"n":"Yvonne Strahovski","r":"Lorna Moon"},{"n":"David Wohl","r":"Mickey"}]}